{"time": 1770810309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932812483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骑车回家）"}
{"time": 1770811246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "113528590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那什么字啊，怎么还是倒着的，学妹你能看出来吗”"}
{"time": 1770811479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845076267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我不太懂诶，看着像是...花鸟?\"秋仔细看了看，才开口"}
{"time": 1770811612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52501254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“星之什么……好生僻的字”"}
{"time": 1770811631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713269999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“星之花鸟？”"}
{"time": 1770811650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710127818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...确实不太懂...\"秋摇摇头，\"可能是神社的某种习惯吧。\""}
{"time": 1770811670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400764423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是，为什么要倒过来写呢？”"}
{"time": 1770811785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802943206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶.....星.....y”努力辨认，然后读了一半意识到了什么，停了下来“这里为什么会有这个....”"}
{"time": 1770811873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652441673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道，但是好像不去不行”"}
{"time": 1770812042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165101534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，为什么不去不行，可能这就是这个神社没什么人的原因?\"秋摇摇头，\"我听说这里供奉的是水神诶...会不会...因为是溺死鬼?\""}
{"time": 1770812468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827891225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”想想周围有没有什么河"}
{"time": 1770812561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926997816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然后山不会有什么大河，想来神弃川最大的河就是名为神弃川的江流了"}
{"time": 1770812609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855938037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“水神不一般都在水边么，怎么供奉在山上，山上的大部分是山神吧..”瞎说中"}
{"time": 1770812653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136756887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"秋认同地点点头，\"就算不在江边，也要在镇上吧...山上，真的很奇怪...果然是溺死鬼吧？\""}
{"time": 1770812688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594731744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哪有那么多鬼……还是‘学校建立在监狱废址上’这种事可信度高一点”"}
{"time": 1770812975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53595170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"高在哪了...\"秋翻了个白眼，不过神社的本体也显露在你们眼前，没有院墙，首先映入眼帘的是一个空荡荡的爬着爬山虎的赛钱箱，当然年久失修的神社本体也免不了被爬山虎侵蚀，并没有看见有人，门房紧闭。"}
{"time": 1770813129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612842444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，为什么我听说的是学校建在坟地上，因为坟地便宜”"}
{"time": 1770813606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525243817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总不能开工之前先刨坟吧，怎么想都不对啦”看着神社门“啊，没开呢……”"}
{"time": 1770813656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054010811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“结果居然没开，不过神様应该还在这里吧”翻出两枚零钱"}
{"time": 1770813722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387828770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm....”先鞠躬，然后推下门试试"}
{"time": 1770815319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696373916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1387828770]倒是没有预想之中的灰尘散落的场面，门扉被你摇了摇，发出牙酸的声音，但是没能推开。你的手上也没染上灰"}
{"time": 1770815657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804340686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔唔唔，好像只能无功而返了”"}
{"time": 1770815730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577102900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "反正也就是一些零钱，投入钱箱中，闭眼祈祷着什么"}
{"time": 1770815752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980558169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(祈祷的内容是?)"}
{"time": 1770815910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341547493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"神山前辈要不要也试试?赛钱箱里赛点钱，似乎可以实现许下的愿望哦?\""}
{"time": 1770815963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184035482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...学妹叫我学姐就好了，前辈什么的感觉好像有点太正式了”"}
{"time": 1770816031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292160740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿出两块钱往钱箱里面赛"}
{"time": 1770816066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502719172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "郑重的拜一拜"}
{"time": 1770816297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173865198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "响起钱币落入空箱的哐当哐当声，\"嗯...但是前辈听起来很好啊?\"秋一副理所当然的样子，\"我一直叫雨纪前辈前辈的。\""}
{"time": 1770816378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948788369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学姐感觉好像更亲近一点”"}
{"time": 1770816686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643605802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?是吗？\"秋眨了眨眼，\"雨纪前辈也觉得是这样吗？\""}
{"time": 1770816835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197973834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔唔唔...”挠挠头，算了不想了"}
{"time": 1770816932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223217686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“学姐叫起来好麻烦……”"}
{"time": 1770816956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748305949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？明明和前辈没什么区别啦”"}
{"time": 1770816989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132726761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“该许的愿倒是都许过了，希望kamisama来点作用吧？当然看不出作用所在也是一种作用吧”"}
{"time": 1770816997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410925654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她的手指戳戳自己的脸，\"不过神山前辈这么觉得的话，我以后就叫你神山学姐咯?\""}
{"time": 1770817028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722579189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不信不信，住在山上的水神什么的...\"秋使劲摇着脑袋。"}
{"time": 1770817047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440982359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5B7F817D63C1EB6D9499EFEE4260E19D.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRAIBb3l93w4iFmLHyHd9d4QGuJTRiwtwQg_wootvj0x8fRkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQY-Qmdraovx6NL_CcSTMSV3oCSlWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMEJ17KGm7En40JbaZNqeRCVcej0HYJdX8tBW8YVHWlkogfN38W00_Lw8EaSozSxg8w,file_size=72624]"}
{"time": 1770817073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517682478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "透过缝看看箱子里面"}
{"time": 1770817529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850442936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "寥寥几枚硬币躺在里面，秋把你拉了回来，“赛钱箱里的钱币是属于供奉神祇的啦，学姐不能乱动心思啦”"}
{"time": 1770817635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877240288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只是刚刚感觉声音好像有点不太对，所以才看看...不过里面看着好像挺正常的”"}
{"time": 1770817669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940262449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学妹不也许点什么愿吗”"}
{"time": 1770817939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032621705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我没什么特别要许的愿望啦。”她摆摆手，看上去对这个神社有些敬而远之的害怕，“感觉许了也不会有什么结果...”末了她还补充了一句"}
{"time": 1770817969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475486594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学妹刚刚可不是这样说的”掐下她的脸"}
{"time": 1770818102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618119907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...”她揉揉自己的脸，“如果学姐希望的话，我也可以投资一次啦。”"}
{"time": 1770818140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257765082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“倒也没必要啦...那我们走吧？”"}
{"time": 1770818255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062223653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“功利一点也没什么不对的吧。真的有人不许愿还要特意来一趟吗？”"}
{"time": 1770818648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310112058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”秋停顿了一下，往塞钱箱里扔下几个银币，随后一副如释重负的样子，“好啦，我们下山吧？”"}
{"time": 1770818706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960786919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧，天也快黑了”"}
{"time": 1770818798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665860027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不如说，天色已经暗了下来。"}
{"time": 1770818800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493882726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rh"}
{"time": 1770818800, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1493882726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1770818800, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "1493882726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100=94"}
{"time": 1770818816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647782564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过敏捷吧"}
{"time": 1770818989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825890683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1770819349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413170198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走过两道鸟居再次踏上杂草蔓延的小径，不知为何总感觉有些心慌，脚下的草像是有了生命一般，虽然是你们的错觉，但总感觉它们在缠绕着你们的脚踝。"}
{"time": 1770819396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144734989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "神山尚且还好，雨纪的行动变得异常艰难，每次抬脚都要出很多倍力、。"}
{"time": 1770819420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462872688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎…怎么……是我腿软了吗？怎么感觉走得这么费力……”"}
{"time": 1770819455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702599641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像.确实有点，学妹怎么样”"}
{"time": 1770819529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906168404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？我的话还好啦...”她看向你们，眨了眨眼，“怎、、怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1770819545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107528086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉..草有点奇怪”"}
{"time": 1770819704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117033093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*用力迈步，低头看看"}
{"time": 1770819714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456533757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....雨纪酱，要不我背你吧..你看起来好像”"}
{"time": 1770819735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909507758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，受到的影响最大”"}
{"time": 1770819746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614076768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“奇怪...”她低头看了看，“好像是有一点...？心理作用吧。哈哈...”干笑了两声，她的身体有些发抖。"}
{"time": 1770819810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540611462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学妹害怕的话...还可以继续抱着我”"}
{"time": 1770819846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535318029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...神山学姐吃得消吗？又是背着前辈...”"}
{"time": 1770819978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403304799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我其实很厉害的...我可是咱们学校剑道社的王牌”"}
{"time": 1770820020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309480457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（show str）"}
{"time": 1770820023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246382809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“把我当成什么了”摇头“下山摔了可麻烦了，可能只是含羞草……”话是这么说，但是怎么说都有点发颤，不自觉加快了些脚步"}
{"time": 1770820231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989353089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我不客气了...”秋拉着神山的胳膊，稍微安心了一些，“我就说今天不应该来神社吧...”"}
{"time": 1770820413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524804803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".st str"}
