{"time": 1770865402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141341803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“明天见。”她点点头，起身往钟表店的店面走去，很快就走进了门。"}
